            <ArticleTitle>[Use of tiapride in internal medicine (author's transl)].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>733-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Tiapride is tested about 47 in-patients among 6 morbid conditions studied. Tiapride is particulary effective in 4 diseases : delirium tremens, nervous and mental disordes associated with alcoholic addiction are obviously improbed in 2/3 of cases ; the betterment of motor and behaviour disordes concerning old people and the prevention of cephalagia succeding spinal puncture is sure with tiapride. The clinical and biological tolerance is excellent particulary in precarious patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
